      "overview_description": {
        "description": "Sendwithus provides software for managing transactional emails outside source code. The platform supports email creation, optimization, and personalization, along with A/B testing, analytics, and triggered or scheduled messages. It integrates with existing email service providers and provides a REST-based API for programmatic access."
      },
